# License

This repository is a build recipe. It does not contain the three upstream
trees. Those trees are git submodules and keep their own licenses. Read the
file inside the submodule after `git submodule update --init`.

| Path | Upstream | License |
| --- | --- | --- |
| `rkrga` | https://github.com/nyanmisaka/rk-mirrors | Apache-2.0 (`rkrga/COPYING`) |
| `rkmpp` | https://github.com/nyanmisaka/mpp | Apache-2.0 (`rkmpp/LICENSES/Apache-2.0`); some files MIT (`rkmpp/LICENSES/MIT`) |
| `ffmpeg-rockchip` | https://github.com/nyanmisaka/ffmpeg-rockchip | LGPL v2.1 or later by default (`ffmpeg-rockchip/COPYING.LGPLv2.1`). This build passes `--enable-gpl` and `--enable-version3`, so the resulting ffmpeg binary is GPL v3 or later (`ffmpeg-rockchip/COPYING.GPLv3`). See `ffmpeg-rockchip/LICENSE.md`. |

`README.md`, `README-vi.md`, `build-all.sh`, and `install-new-to-usr-local.sh`
are documentation for this pinned build and are released under Apache-2.0.
The text of that license is the same one used by `rkrga` and `rkmpp`:

https://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0

Copyright of the submodule source stays with its upstream authors.
Do not remove or replace the license files inside the submodules.
